  <title>Pronunciation dictionary</title>
  <p>
    The pronunciation dictionary lets you replace how Orca speaks specific words. The settings
    below control its use and its entries.
  </p>
  <p>
    For example, replace an abbreviation with its expanded form or use a phonetic spelling for a
    name. Matching is case-insensitive and applies to whole words. Application-specific
    pronunciation entries let you use different replacements in different applications.
  </p>
  <section id="settings-pronunciation-dictionary">
    <title>Settings</title>
    <section id="settings-pronunciation-dictionary-pronunciation-dictionary-manager-pronunciation">
