      <p>
        <em style="strong">Preferences location:</em>
        <gui>Pronunciation</gui> category.
      </p>
      <p>
        Add a new entry from the dictionary header. Edit or delete an existing entry from its
        row.
      </p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Add New Pronunciation</gui>: Opens a dialog
            where you can add a word and the replacement text Orca should speak.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Pronunciation Dictionary</gui>: Lists words and
            the replacement text Orca sends to speech before speaking them.
          </p>
          <list>
            <item>
              <p>
                <gui>Edit Pronunciation</gui>: Opens a dialog
                where you can change the selected pronunciation entry.
